flowchart TD
    A[Charge Event] --> B[Category-at-Evt Pricing]
    B --> C[Apply Multiplier]
    C --> D[Apply Discounts]
    D --> E[Calculate GST]
    E --> F[Net Amount]
    F --> G[Ledger Entry]
    G --> H[Update Running Bill]
    H --> I[Check Demand Trigger]
    I -->|Bill > 80%| J[Create Demand]
    I -->|Bill <= 80%| K[No Demand]
    J --> L[Record Demand]
    K --> M[Continue Processing]
    L --> M
